{"candidateAnswer":"Paris","evidence":"[D2:5 | 2:32 pm on 29 January, 2023] Gina: Wow, nice spot! Where is it? Got any other features you want to think about before you decide? Paris?! That is really great Jon! Never had a chance to visit it. Been only to Rome once.\n[D15:1 | 10:04 am on 19 June, 2023] Jon: Hey Gina, hope you're doing great! Still working on my biz. Took a short trip last week to Rome to clear my mind a little.","itemId":"urn:uuid:3329604a-66a7-51a1-a2a8-a7aacf3e14e4","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:951cd5a681e4db5bdf27d88c83c5b9a95fec070ed52aa6deed25f7f624e4b6ec","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which city have both Jean and John visited?","referenceAnswer":"Rome","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"951cd5a681e4db5bdf27d88c83c5b9a95fec070ed52aa6deed25f7f624e4b6ec"}}]}